      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your car is not broken; it is simply waiting for a new driver, and you are the only one who knows how to start it. The engine you feel is still there, just dimmed by the absence of fuel, but it is not gone. You are not finished; you are just in the quietest, most dangerous place between the past and the future, where the only way forward is to take one small step at a time.",
